<concept base="Anywhere" importance="optional" id="t00677">
	<title>Surround view monitor auto On</title>
	<conbody>
		<p>With the vehicle on, select <menucascade><uicontrol outputclass="a1701754">Settings</uicontrol><uicontrol outputclass="a1701772">Vehicle</uicontrol><uicontrol outputclass="a1804409">Driver assistance</uicontrol><uicontrol outputclass="a1804506">Parking safety</uicontrol><uicontrol outputclass="a1805292">Surround view monitor auto On</uicontrol></menucascade> from the infotainment system screen to use the function.</p>
		<note type="note">
			<p>For more details on Surround View Monitor Auto On, refer to <xref href="t00677.dita#t00677"/>.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>